            [email] => CHARLIE@EXAMPLE.COM
        )

)
```

### Key Details:
* **`str_ends_with()`**: Cleanly checks the suffix (requires PHP 8.0+).
* **`strtolower()`**: Ensures the check is case-insensitive, since email domains are case-insensitive.
