    [1, 2, 3],
    [4, 5, 6],
    [7, 8, 9],
];

print_r(sumRows($matrix)); // [6, 15, 24]
```

`array_map` applies `array_sum` to each row, returning a new array of row sums without modifying the original.

## Basic implementation

```php
